/* MageRide Passenger — English.
 *
 * The keys are `apps/passenger-android/src/main/res/values…/strings.xml`'s, so a screen group
 * porting its Android copy has a one-to-one mapping and a divergence between the two apps is a diff
 * rather than an archaeology exercise. The five menu rows are the exception and the reason is
 * Section C: the Android drawer's keys are `drawer_*` and this app has a Menu tab, so they are
 * `menu_*` here. See `PassengerTab`.
 *
 * `LocalizationTests` fails the build on a key that exists in one file and not the others, on a
 * translation left equal to its English, and on a format specifier dropped in translation. It also
 * fails on a key nothing in the app references, which is what stops this file accumulating copy for
 * a screen that was never built.
 *
 * A `.strings` comment is a C comment and does NOT nest: writing `values*` followed by a slash
 * inside one closes it early and everything after is garbage the parser refuses, which makes
 * `NSDictionary(contentsOf:)` answer nil and every key in the app resolve to its own name. C089
 * found seven of those. Write a path without the glob.
 */

